  id: Forest_Cabin_2
  headerName: "House Notes \u2014 2"
  content: "\tThe mountain screamed last night. Not a rockslide \u2014 something
    older. A sound like the roots of enormous trees being torn from the earth by
    force beyond reason. The ground shook until the wall clock fell and stopped at
    3:14 in the morning."
